        <mxCell id="noteActAs" parent="boundary" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Act-as challenge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One weekly action the Future Self would take and the current self would avoid. Matched to domain, sub-type, and current level; escalates across the 90-day journey; creates real-world exposure where appropriate; third-party reactions can become evidence.&lt;br&gt;Ascenders receive two act-as challenges, with at least one carrying real exposure." vertex="1">
